%% Research note: topics/transaction-lifecycle.md
sequenceDiagram
  participant App as Application
  participant Sub as Submitting participant
  participant Seq as Sequencer
  participant Conf as Confirming participants
  participant Med as Mediator
  App->>Sub: Submit Daml command
  Sub->>Sub: Interpret and build encrypted views
  Sub->>Seq: Confirmation request batch
  Seq->>Seq: Order and timestamp
  Seq->>Conf: Deliver entitled views
  Seq->>Med: Deliver informees and policy
  Conf->>Conf: Validate Daml, authority and ACS
  Conf->>Seq: Signed approve or reject
  Seq->>Med: Ordered responses
  Med->>Seq: Commit or reject verdict
  Seq->>Conf: Final verdict
  Conf->>Conf: Apply or discard local effects
  Seq-->>Sub: Completion path
  Sub-->>App: Completion
